OL,3,AMet Police boss 'wouldn't be surprised'
OL,4,Aif more allegations made about Brand
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrand was acquitted of two other rape
OL,7,Fcharges and one allegation of attempted
OL,8,Findecent assault. The 51-year-old will
OL,9,Fbe sentenced on Monday.
